{title: Aadmi Jo Kahta Hai}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Laxmikant Pyarelal}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Kabhi socha [G#]ta hun ke,        [Gm]main kuchh ka [Cm]hun
[Cm]Kabhi socha [G#]ta hun ke,        [Gm]main chup ra [Cm]hun
[Cm]Adami jo kahata hai,        [G#]adami jo sunata hai
[Fm]Zindagibhar wo sadaaye,        [A#]pichha karati [Cm]hai
[Cm]Adami jo deta hai,        [G#]adami jo leta hai
[Fm]Zindagibhar wo duwaayen,        [A#]pichha karati [Cm]hai
[Cm]Koi bhi ho har khwaab to,        [A#]sachcha nahin [Cm]hota
[Cm]Bahot jyaada [A#]pyaar bhi,        [Gm]achchha nahin [Cm]hota
[Cm]Kabhi daaman chhudaana,        [G#]ho to mushkil [Gm]ho
[Cm]Pyaar ke rishten tute to,        [G#]pyaar ke raste chhute to
[Fm]Raaste men fir wafaayen,        [A#]pichha karati [Cm]hai
[Cm]Kabhi kabhi man dhup ke,        [A#]kaaran [Cm]tarasata hai
[Cm]Kabhi kabhi fir [A#]jhum ke,        [Gm]saawan [Cm]barasata hai
[Cm]Palak jhapaken yaha,        [G#]mausam badal [Gm]jaaye
[Cm]Pyaas kabhi mitati nahi,        [G#]ek bund bhi milati nahin
[Fm]Aur kabhi rimajhim ghataayen,        [A#]pichha karati [Cm]hai
